  "concept": {
    "zh": "一对三 · 通道与电池换位",
    "en": "One versus three · Shifting gates and batteries"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "和三台机器人争抢 12 块电池。电池抢完或打满 21 回合时，必须独占第一。同回合争抢同一块电池时，拾取优先权按芽芽、琥珀号、青玉号、钴蓝号的顺序每回合轮换。第 3、7、11 回合结束后，通道改道，尚未被拿走的指定电池换位。机器人或电池占着的门格当次保持打开。对手会根据比分和通道调整目标。从容模式下，同一程序要赢下三张地图。",
    "en": "Race three rivals for 12 batteries. Finish first outright when the batteries run out or after 21 turns. For contested pickups, priority rotates each turn from Sprout to Amber, Jade, and Cobalt. Gates switch and designated unclaimed batteries relocate after turns 3, 7, and 11. An occupied gate stays open for that shift. Rivals change targets with the scores and open routes. In Relaxed mode, one program must win on all three maps."
  },
